---
title: "SD-01 Sign In (UML Sequence Diagram)"
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Developer
  participant B as Browser (SPA)
  participant MW as httpserver middleware
  participant H as api.AuthHandler
  participant A as auth.Service
  participant DB as store

  U->>B: enter username + password
  B->>MW: POST /api/v1/auth/login
  MW->>MW: RateLimit (per IP + account)
  MW->>H: Login(request)
  H->>A: Login(ctx, user, pass, ip, ua)
  A->>DB: UserByUsername(user)
  alt user not found or inactive
    A->>A: VerifyPassword(dummyHash) (equal timing)
    A-->>H: errs.Unauthenticated
    H-->>B: 401 "Invalid username or password"
  else user found
    A->>A: VerifyPassword(hash, pass) — argon2id
    alt password wrong
      A->>DB: record failure (audit event)
      A-->>H: errs.Unauthenticated
      H-->>B: 401 "Invalid username or password"
    else password correct
      A->>A: NewToken() → session id + CSRF token
      A->>DB: INSERT sessions(id_hash, csrf, expires_at)
      A-->>H: Session
      H-->>B: 200 {user, csrf_token} + Set-Cookie anvil_session (HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax)
      B-->>U: dashboard
    end
  end
